# The repository's .clang-tidy, less one check for the tests here.
# readability-function-cognitive-complexity is disabled: a gtest body is a straight sequence of
# EXPECT_*/ASSERT_* calls, and each macro expands to branches that the check counts, so nearly every
# TEST body exceeds its threshold without any real branching of its own. Splitting a test into helper
# functions to please it would hide what the test checks. The check stays on for the code under test.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity
